          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "@components/formdef/number-field.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "lib/formdef/field-labels.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/formdef/field-labels.ts"
        }
      ],
      "docs": "Register it in lib/formdef: widgets: { number: NumberField }. Its value is number | undefined, so the schema allows undefined. It is meant for counts and whole numbers; take a text field with inputMode: 'decimal' for amounts and decimals, which users type with a comma.",
      "categories": ["form", "field"]
    },
